# Claude Code
#
# The directory is ignored by default so personal overrides never land in a
# commit; the shared, reviewed pieces are whitelisted back in below. Keep new
# entries specific — a bare `!.claude/` would start tracking local settings.
#
# `.claude/*` and not `.claude/`: git refuses to re-include a path whose parent
# directory is itself excluded, so ignoring the *directory* would make every `!`
# line below silently dead. Ignoring its *contents* leaves them re-includable.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/docs/

# Personal, never shared: settings.local.json holds per-developer overrides and
# .mcp.json can carry credentials.
.claude/settings.local.json
.mcp.json

# AI tooling configuration
.codex/
.github/prompts/
.github/skills/
openspec/

